    "created_at": "2020-05-21T15:34:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-21T15:34:47Z",
    "body": "Those refer to any non-primitive value (i.e., object value) which is associated with the `Location` object, and accessible via a property on it. I think the proposed `fragmentDirective` is one of those, right? I.e. it's an empty object, not a string?",
